{"title":"Royal Guard","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Royal Guard is a guard — a named <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> seen at level 15 (warrior).</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p></p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>head</i> Iron Spikedhelm</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>main hand</i> Iron Sword</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>off hand</i> Iron Shield</span></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find Royal Guard</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>King Jordon&#39;s Tomb</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 4×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-177\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"royal-guard\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">11 drops</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Skeletons</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/skeleton-king\">Skeleton King</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/the-bell-ringer\">The Bell-Ringer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/king-jordon\">King Jordon</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/7d8016b2c950ec8a56ed.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Royal Guard</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a></td></tr><tr><th>Role</th><td>guard</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>15</td></tr><tr><th>Class</th><td>warrior</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>46</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}